---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { business as b } from '../data/business.js';
const updated = 'November 22, 2026';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Skin Restore"
  description="How Skin Restore in San Clemente collects, uses and protects client information, including email and text message details."
>
  <section class="section page">
    <div class="prose">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <p>
        This policy explains what information {b.name} collects, how we use it, and the
        choices you have. {b.name} is located at {b.street}, {b.city}, {b.region} {b.postal}.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Contact details:</strong> your name, email address and mobile phone number,
          which you give us when you book an appointment, fill in a client form, send a
          message through this website, or sign up to hear from us.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Appointment and treatment details:</strong> the services you book, your
          appointment history, and the skin history and product information you share with
          us so we can treat you safely.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Purchase details:</strong> what you buy from us. Card payments are processed
          by our payment provider; we do not store full card numbers.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Website usage:</strong> basic information about visits to this site, such as
          pages viewed and the general source of the visit, collected through analytics and
          advertising measurement tools.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To book, confirm and manage your appointments.</li>
        <li>To provide treatments and recommend products suited to your skin.</li>
        <li>To answer your questions and messages.</li>
        <li>
          To send you news, offers and product recommendations by email or text message,
          when you have agreed to receive them.
        </li>
        <li>To understand how this website is used and to measure our advertising.</li>
        <li>
          To show ads for {b.name} and our online store, Skin Restore Rx, on platforms such
          as Instagram and Facebook, as described under Advertising below.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Text messages</h2>
      <p>
        If you agree to receive text messages from {b.name}, we may text you about
        appointments, offers and products, including products sold by our online store,
        Skin Restore Rx. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply.
      </p>
      <p>
        Reply STOP to any text to unsubscribe at any time. Reply HELP for help, or call us
        at <a href={b.phoneHref}>{b.phone}</a>. Agreeing to receive texts is not a condition
        of booking or buying anything.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>
          Mobile information and text messaging consent will not be shared with or sold to
          third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.
        </strong>
        Your mobile number and consent are shared only with the service providers that send
        our messages on our behalf.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we share information with</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell your personal information. We share it only with service providers
        that help us run the business, such as our booking and payment system, our email
        and text messaging platform, and our website host, and only so they can provide
        those services to us. Advertising platforms receive client email addresses only
        as described under Advertising below. We may also disclose information when the law
        requires it.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        We may use client email addresses to show ads for {b.name} and our online store,
        Skin Restore Rx, on advertising platforms such as Instagram and Facebook, and to
        avoid showing you ads that are not relevant to you. To do this, we send email
        addresses to the platform in a hashed (scrambled) form so it can match them to its
        own accounts. We do not sell this information, and we do not send mobile phone
        numbers or text messaging consent to advertising platforms.
      </p>
      <p>
        To opt out, call <a href={b.phoneHref}>{b.phone}</a> or use our
        <a href="/contact">contact page</a> and we will remove your email address from
        these advertising lists.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Unsubscribe from emails using the link at the bottom of any email.</li>
        <li>Unsubscribe from texts by replying STOP.</li>
        <li>
          Ask us to stop using your email address for advertising, by calling
          <a href={b.phoneHref}>{b.phone}</a> or using our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          Ask us what information we hold about you, or ask us to correct or delete it, by
          calling <a href={b.phoneHref}>{b.phone}</a> or using our
          <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Keeping information safe</h2>
      <p>
        We keep client information in the systems of established service providers and
        limit access to the people who need it to serve you. No system is perfectly secure,
        but we take reasonable steps to protect your information.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        If we change this policy, we will post the new version on this page and update the
        date above.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        {b.name}<br />
        {b.street}<br />
        {b.city}, {b.region} {b.postal}<br />
        <a href={b.phoneHref}>{b.phone}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
